|-----|--------|
| check deny `no_cap_fetch` | OK |
| check allow `ok_net_cap_fetch` | OK |
| product check deny `no_cap_fetch` | OK |
| emit fetch without NetCap fail-closed | OK |
| runtime Net forge (after Env) | **not reached** (smoke fail=1 earlier) |

**caps_matrix overall FAIL** — Env product runtime broken by policy-getenv wire;
Sys emit string/ident corruption on tip host; Net static/check rails still OK.

